<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 23.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/95    100/102    UNQ    159/164</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98    102/104  175/180  185/190</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was quiet on Monday with quotes hovering around their recent levels, traders said. Although recent berth congestion caused some cargo lifting problems, suppliers failed to raise their offers significantly as demand was poor. The berth congestion was expected to last until the end of June.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
